Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.19,0:02:21.99,OP JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5\1c&HC4E33B&}I cannot believe it!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.99,0:02:24.19,OP JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5\1c&HC4E33B&}The world I used to know is gone
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.39,0:02:29.39,OP JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5}I just woke up one day and everything changed
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.99,0:02:34.39,OP JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5}Zetsubou risou
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.19,0:02:39.19,OP JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5}Yudanerare majiwaru sekai
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.59,0:02:41.19,OP JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5}Are you excited?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.19,0:02:46.19,OP JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5}Netsu obiru toiki jouki suru hoho
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.19,0:02:50.79,OP JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5}Shisen no saki de kimi ga warau
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.09,0:02:54.79,OP JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5\1c&HC4E33B&}Namida ukabetemo sakendemo
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.79,0:02:57.09,OP JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5\1c&HC4E33B&}Tomaranai shoudou
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.99,0:03:04.39,OP JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5}Nigirishimeta yakusoku hanasanaide kimi wo kanjiru kara
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.89,0:03:10.19,OP JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5}Tsuranuite miseru yo kakujitsu na toko made
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.19,0:03:15.29,OP JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5\1c&HC4E33B&}Daremo shiranai michi no ryouiki nara oshihiraite
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.29,0:03:20.99,OP JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5\1c&H1181F1&}Omoidasu yo tsuyoku mabushii hitomi wo
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.99,0:03:26.69,OP JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5}Daremo yaranai nara jibun de yaru shika nai
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.69,0:03:30.39,OP JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5}Just gotta do it
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.19,0:02:21.99,OP BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5\1c&HC4E33B&}Eu não posso acreditar nisso!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.99,0:02:24.19,OP BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5\1c&HC4E33B&}O mundo que eu conhecia já não existe mais.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.39,0:02:29.39,OP BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5}Um dia acordei e tudo mudou.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.99,0:02:34.39,OP BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5}Desespero, ideais...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.19,0:02:39.19,OP BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5}e um mundo entrelaçado que foi confiado a mim.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.59,0:02:41.19,OP BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5}Você está animado?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.19,0:02:46.19,OP BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5}Sua respiração está quente, suas bochechas estão coradas.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.19,0:02:50.79,OP BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5}Vejo você rindo em meus olhos.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.09,0:02:54.79,OP BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5\1c&HC4E33B&}Não importa quantas lágrimas eu chore, quantos gritos eu grite,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.79,0:02:57.09,OP BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5\1c&HC4E33B&}não consigo parar este impulso.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.99,0:03:04.39,OP BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5}A promessa a que me agarro, não vou desistir, porque o sinto.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.89,0:03:10.19,OP BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5}Vou certificar até que você esteja seguro.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.19,0:03:15.29,OP BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5\1c&HC4E33B&}Se é um território desconhecido, eu o abrirei.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.29,0:03:20.99,OP BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5\1c&H1181F1&}Eu me lembrarei desses olhos fortes e deslumbrantes.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.99,0:03:26.69,OP BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5}Se ninguém o faz, eu mesmo tenho que fazê-lo.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.69,0:03:30.39,OP BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5}Só tem que ser feito.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,SekkonSigns,,0,0,0,,
